titre$ Key to the species of Arrhenia- Gro Gulden
com$ Gro Gulden A preliminary guide to the macromycetes in the Finse area / GF 2011
1,2 $ Stipe well developed
1,3 $ Stipe rudimentary to absent
2,0 $ Stipe central, hymenophore lamellate $ A. griseopallida
2,0 $ Stipe lateral, hymenophore reduced $ A. auriscalpium
3,0 $ Hymenophore lamellate $ A. acerosa
3,4 $ Hymenophore smooth to veined
4,0 $ Fruitbodies 1-5 cm, greyish brown $ A. lobata
4,0 $ Fruitbodies 0.5-1.5 cm, white to pale beige $ A. retiruga
